                        "form": "neverminds"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dd5c9a17-05fe-3e37-8796-1a3bf102a059",
                        "entry_id": "a51d649c-45a0-3788-a824-e61aaa46cff0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "(Régionalisme) Concentration particulière sur quelque chose, attention."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "États-Unis"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1d2d2b7d-81c6-4755-8374-6614410037b4",
                                "sense_id": "dd5c9a17-05fe-3e37-8796-1a3bf102a059",
                                "text": "Hell, they’ve got groundrules and guidelines comin’ out the kazoo, but do they pay any nevermind to ’em?"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ba17c784-0d89-3b7f-a5f5-8cf3553a847a",
                        "entry_id": "a51d649c-45a0-3788-a824-e61aaa46cff0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "(Régionalisme) Inquiétude, affaire."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "États-Unis"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c4bbd4c-64f5-4f05-ab11-0468accc7250",
                                "sense_id": "ba17c784-0d89-3b7f-a5f5-8cf3553a847a",
                                "text": "... buy what he wants. It's none of your nevermind."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df878501-f406-4848-8bff-d5f26700a5c4",
                                "sense_id": "ba17c784-0d89-3b7f-a5f5-8cf3553a847a",
                                "text": "\"Neither one,\" Joe said. \"Not that it's any nevermind o' yours, Mr. Wickersham."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2e18089b-d676-338c-8a49-37583bc6b810",
                        "entry_id": "a51d649c-45a0-3788-a824-e61aaa46cff0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "(Régionalisme) Conséquence, changement significatif ou effet sur une situation ou un état ; différence."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "États-Unis"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bfa48f2e-6d81-46c0-b039-e5296aded6da",
                                "sense_id": "2e18089b-d676-338c-8a49-37583bc6b810",
                                "text": "If'n it makes any nevermind, you'll be grubbin' alongside me."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "598ea738-468d-4832-85ec-a8f242a700d3",
                                "sense_id": "2e18089b-d676-338c-8a49-37583bc6b810",
                                "text": "Let 'em say she was his mistress, that she was a witch. Wasn't true, but it didn't make any nevermind if they thought it was. Nice woman, quiet, could tell the cards."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "613ea76f-bd62-4dc5-a245-2fe4fca966a4",
                                "sense_id": "2e18089b-d676-338c-8a49-37583bc6b810",
                                "text": "Either way—doesn't mean no nevermind to me, you understand."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
